    note: 'Nike’s own chart lists hip equal to chest at XS through L, diverging only from XL upward; that is how Nike publishes it, not a transcription error. Tall sizes (S through 4XL, select styles) run 1.75" longer in the body with sleeves adjusted by silhouette; Tall bottoms add 2" of inseam and 0.5" of rise.',
    noteAfter: true,
